@startuml
!include _style.puml
title F17 本地运行部署图
node "同一台开发电脑" {
  node "浏览器" {
    artifact "React 页面" as UI
  }
  node "Node.js 进程\nVite 127.0.0.1:5180" as Vite
  node "Python 虚拟环境\nUvicorn 127.0.0.1:8000" as API {
    component "FastAPI + Agent + 本地 OCR" as App
  }
  database "backend/smarthire.db\nSQLite" as DB
  folder "backend/uploads" as Files
  artifact "backend/.env\n本地配置，不提交 Git" as Env
  artifact "启动软件.cmd\nstart-local.ps1" as Start
}
cloud "互联网" {
  component "DeepSeek" as LLM
  component "Lever / JSON Resume" as Source
}
UI --> Vite : HTTP 页面与 /api
Vite --> App : /api 反向代理
App --> DB : aiosqlite
App --> Files
App ..> Env : 读取配置
App --> LLM : HTTPS 443
App --> Source : HTTPS 443
Start --> Vite : 后台启动
Start --> API : 迁移后启动
note bottom of Vite
5180 是 Windows 启动脚本端口。
直接运行 Vite 的默认配置仍为 5173。
end note
footer 当前已验证的本地拓扑 | 监听回环地址，不表示已发布公网
@enduml
